


SET description, "mu+ 120GeV run, trigger from MiB (plastic) + UniNa Plastic, BSO UG11, angle 180deg. CH1: 3010 - filter; CH2 6050 - CAEN amp 18; CH3 LYSO; CH4 MCP; CH5 Plastic 1x1x1; CH6 Trigger"
ODBSET "/Runinfo/Run description", $description

LOOP 1
   TRANSITION start
   WAIT events, 10000
   TRANSITION stop

ENDLOOP